      "content": "Do",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/crypto-aes-padding-oracle.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:115aaecd3b7c75d237e0f45910ec85c96cc700424cc793db7317224a8e73a3b8",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "CBC padding oracle",
      "section": [
        "CBC padding oracle",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 构造两块：前一块可控 IV/C，后一块是目标密文。\n2. 从末字节开始翻转前块字节，枚举 0..255，找到使 padding 合法的值。\n3. 逐字节恢复中间值，再与前一块异或得到明文；记录每次查询。\n4. 控制请求量，避免把 oracle 探测写成高并发爆破。",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 17,
      "truncated": false
    },
